{"id":"01a0657e-0264-717a-88d5-956b7969d35e","chapterSlug":"rwInterlude - Pisces (Revised)","paragraph":201,"wording":"[Tailor]","event":"named","holderQuote":"There were three. Most of the caravan were Human or Stitchfolk, with some spattering of Garuda, the natives of Chandrar. However, Pisces also saw a Dullahan [Tailor] amongst them. Qshom, who had run into a debt after a fire consumed his shop…his armor was plain metal, and he often cursed his justifiable misfortune."}
