{"id":"01a0657e-0264-7ebe-805d-b165fdc2a338","chapterSlug":"rw8-38 H","paragraph":655,"wording":"[Tailor]","event":"named","holderSlug":"qshom","holderQuote":"Eloque whispered. She began to shudder—until Qshom laid a gauntleted hand on her arm. His metal was plain, but it was steel, and his fingers were deft, a [Tailor]’s careful fingers, as he dug at the first row of thread."}
